# Sparklines: gtExtras Method

Before preparing the sales report by product using **gtExtras** functions, the code chunk below prepares the data.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
report <- coffeechain %>%
  mutate(Year = year(Date)) %>%
  filter(Year == "2013") %>%
  mutate(Month = month(Date,
                        label = TRUE,
                        abbr = TRUE)) %>%
  group_by(Product, Month) %>%
  summarise(Sales = sum(Sales)) %>%
  ungroup()
```
:::


`gtExtras` functions almost exclusively require a data frame with list columns. The code chunk below converts the `report` data frame into list columns.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
report %>%
  group_by(Product) %>%
  summarize('Monthly Sales' = list(Sales),
            .groups = "drop")
```

